{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32609","headline":"过沧浪峡 · 刘沧","name":"过沧浪峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山叠云重一径幽，苍苔古石濑清流。\n出岩树色见来静，落涧泉声长自秋。\n远入虚明思白帝，寒生浩景想沧洲。\n如何地近东西路，马足车轮不暂留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}